borderWidth    border                   standard*
breakpoints    breakpoints              tailwind, bootstrap
contrast       contrast                 wcag-aa*, wcag-aaa, apca
density        density                  compact, comfortable*, spacious
elevation      elevation                tailwind*, flat, layered-5
iconSizes      icons                    standard*, carbon-like
layoutGrid     grid                     12-col*, 16-col
letterSpacing  typography.letterSpacing standard*, tailwind
lineHeight     typography.lineHeights   standard*, relaxed
motion         motion                   tailwind-like*, material-like, carbon-productive, carbon-expressive, minimal
neutrals       color.neutral            neutral*, slate, gray, zinc, stone
opacity        opacity                  standard*
radius         radius                   sharp, soft*, round, pill-heavy
rampMethods    color.ramp               oklch*, tailwind-11, radix-12, m3-tonal, contrast-targeted
semanticRoles  -                        primary, destructive, success, warning, info
